search index=mail final_action=discard "filter.routeDirection"=inbound signature=*
``` Template: Proofpoint (rejected inbound messages). ```
``` Modele : Proofpoint (messages entrants rejetes). A ADAPTER : index, champs selon votre add-on. ```
| where signature != ""
| eval severity = case(match(signature, "phish|impostor|malware"), "critical",
                       match(signature, "definite|blocked"),        "high",
                       true(),                                      "medium")
| eval src_ip = src, dest_host = dest, action = "blocked",
       dc = "CLOUD"
| fields _time, src_ip, Country, src_lat, src_lon, dc, severity, signature, dest_host, action
